ents together or have a sculpt-off!\n\nWhen you're happy with your creation, you can upload to the SculptrVR content gallery and let others see the incredible things you've made. You can also browse the gallery with hundreds of creations!\n\nCreations made in SculptrVR can be exported to OBJ or FBX formats for 3D printing or sharing online!\n\nIn your world, anything is possible.", "short_description": "SculptrVR's 10,000x zoom enables massive creations with tiny details. SculptrVR makes it easy to create, explore, and share incredible sculptures with friends. With SculptrVR\u2019s intuitive tools, but powerful tools, you can make anything!"}]}, "developer_name": "SculptrVR, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SculptrVR, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.sculptrvr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "EXPLORATION", "PRODUCTIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "358248065824597"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 13, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4213370125563605"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2121486061719037"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1100979841551064"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "3546470832301022"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "402569567460909"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "496072107626748"},